'''yrreJ''' is an [[NPC]] in the [[Rift Dimension]], more specifically in its {{Zone|Wizard Tower (Rift)}}. 

== Purpose ==
'''yrreJ''' grants the player's unclaimed items, similar to one of the purposes {{NPCSprite|Jerry}} serves on the player's [[Private Island]]. They only appear when the player has items to claim.

